    "description": "The Delivery Tracking API allows consumers to access real-time tracking information for food delivery orders. By utilizing this endpoint, users can retrieve the current status, estimated delivery times, and detailed progress of their deliveries. This functionality is essential for customers wanting to stay informed about their food orders and businesses aiming to enhance customer experience through transparency. Typical users include restaurant operators, delivery service providers, and customers seeking to monitor their food delivery end-to-end.",
